    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kilroe East, Inverin, Co. Galway\r\nExceptional 4-Bedroom detached residence with wonderful Galway Bay & Burren Views, a short stroll to the superb Trá Mór beach!\r\n\r\nSet on an elevated site with a prized 'southern aspect', this impressive detached residence enjoys wonderful views across Galway Bay towards the Burren in Co. Clare. Surrounded by mature landscaped gardens, the property offers privacy, space and a warm, welcoming atmosphere — ideal for family living or as a tranquil coastal retreat.\r\n\r\nThe home is approached via a private driveway providing off-street parking for up to three cars, with additional benefits including a large attached garage, outbuildings, expansive rear garden, and  patio areas perfect for outdoor dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully designed with a natural flow between living and sleeping areas.\r\n\r\nA welcoming entrance porch leads into the front hallway from which there is access to a study/home office and a well-proportioned ground floor bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the split-level living room, a characterful and cosy space centred around a solid fuel stove with feature stone surround leading to a gloreous light filled sunroom with vaulted ceiling, perfectly positioned to capture the southern sunshine and elevated views over Galway Bay.\r\n\r\nReturning through the living area, glass panel doors opens into a beautifully sized kitchen full of natural light, texture and a comforting energy — an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nOff the kitchen there is a practical back porch, cloakroom/storage area, and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAlso located on the ground floor is a stunning master suite, comprising a walk-in wardrobe, private sauna, walk-in wardrobe and a spacious ensuite bathroom featuring twin basins, a shower, and a relaxing corner bath.  \r\n\r\nUpstairs you will find two further bedrooms, a second family bathroom, walk-in hotpress and a chill-out lounge space.\r\n\r\nAdditional Accommodation & Garage\r\n\r\nThe large attached garage offers exceptional potential, with stair access to a substantial overhead space suitable for conversion into two additional bedrooms, and a plumbed bathroom.\r\n\r\nAccess to the garage is via a rear hallway, which also provides internal access to the staircase leading to the above-garage accommodation ideal for guests, extended family, or a home office/studio conversion.  This area can easily convert to a separate independent unit if required.\r\n\r\nOutdoor Space\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys generous front and rear gardens, beautifully matured with established planting and lawn areas. The  south/west patio benefit from the home’s sunny orientation, making the most of long summer evenings and the spectacular coastal setting."
      },
